{"text":"Then you get smart. You drag wet, rotting logs right next to your door, and pile dead leaves on top. Every few days, you roll one over. There are always grubs underneath. For the first time since the impact, you have a farm. Scientists think that's how so many small animals made it: everything that needed fresh plants starved, but the things that lived on the dead kept going. Rule four: eat what eats the dead.","mood":"story","settings":{"stability":0.3,"style":0.6,"speed":1.1},"alignment":{"characters":["T","h","e","n"," ","y","o","u"," ","g","e","t"," ","s","m","a","r","t","."," ","Y","o","u"," ","d","r","a","g"," ","w","e","t",","," ","r","o","t","t","i","n","g"," ","l","o","g","s"," ","r","i","g","h","t"," ","n","e","x","t"," ","t","o"," ","y","o","u","r"," ","d","o","o","r",","," ","a","n","d"," ","p","i","l","e"," ","d","e","a","d"," ","l","e","a","v","e","s"," ","o","n"," ","t","o","p","."," ","E","v","e","r","y"," ","f","e","w"," ","d","a","y","s",","," ","y","o","u"," ","r","o","l","l"," ","o","n","e"," ","o","v","e","r","."," ","T","h","e","r","e"," ","a","r","e"," ","a","l","w","a","y","s"," ","g","r","u","b","s"," ","u","n","d","e","r","n","e","a","t","h","."," ","F","o","r"," ","t","h","e"," ","f","i","r","s","t"," ","t","i","m","e"," ","s","i","n","c","e"," ","t","h","e"," ","i","m","p","a","c","t",","," ","y","o","u"," ","h","a","v","e"," ","a"," ","f","a","r","m","."," ","S","c","i","e","n","t","i","s","t","s"," ","t","h","i","n","k"," ","t","h","a","t","'","s"," ","h","o","w"," ","s","o"," ","m","a","n","y"," ","s","m","a","l","l"," ","a","n","i","m","a","l","s"," ","m","a","d","e"," ","i","t",":"," ","e","v","e","r","y","t","h","i","n","g"," ","t","h","a","t"," ","n","e","e","d","e","d"," ","f","r","e","s","h"," ","p","l","a","n","t","s"," ","s","t","a","r","v","e","d",","," ","b","u","t"," ","t","h","e"," ","t","h","i","n","g","s"," ","t","h","a","t"," ","l","i","v","e","d"," ","o","n"," ","t","h","e"," ","d","e","a","d"," ","k","e","p","